# Gold Portfolio Tracker Frontend – Project Specification

Use this document as the single source of truth. We are using a **Feature-Based Architecture**.

---

## 1. Project Overview

- **Type:** Frontend Web Application (Next.js 14+ App Router).
- **Goal:** Public gold price tracking & Guest calculator + Authenticated Portfolio Management.
- **Access:**
  - **Public:** Landing page, Live Ticker, Profit Calculator (No DB save).
  - **Private:** Dashboard, Transaction History (Requires Google Login).
- **Deployment:** Dockerized for Dokploy.

---

## 2. Tech Stack

- **Framework:** Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- **Language:** TypeScript
- **State:** Redux Toolkit (RTK) + RTK Query
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS + Shadcn UI (Dark/Light Mode)
- **Architecture:** **Feature-Based** (`features/`, `views/`, `shared/`)

---

